  "reason": "The strongest completed result is RNA-only multiprofile with scvi_n200 and avgpool (0.650 accuracy, 0.628 F1), and avgpool beat transformer for PCA multiprofile (0.591 vs 0.519), but that aggregation comparison is based on only one encoder. config_006 keeps the promising multiprofile + scvi_n200 setting and changes only aggregation to transformer, directly testing whether the transformer penalty persists with a stronger RNA encoder. This is a clean one-factor extension of the current best direction, reduces uncertainty about aggregation before investing in more complex multimodal settings, and may either confirm avgpool or reveal a competitive transformer configuration."
}

